問題原因： 你的 SQL Server 版本比較舊，TRIM() 函數不支援（SQL Server 2017 才開始有）。

✅ 修正後的 SQL（相容舊版本）
WITH SplitValues AS (
    SELECT 
        b.CustPurposeOfAcc,
        a.NEW_CIF_KEY,
        a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY,
        LTRIM(RTRIM(value)) AS single_code
    FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP a
    JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b 
        ON a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
    CROSS APPLY STRING_SPLIT(b.CustPurposeOfAcc, '|') 
    WHERE b.CustPurposeOfAcc IS NOT NULL
)
SELECT 
    CustPurposeOfAcc,
    NEW_CIF_KEY,
    SOURCE_CIF_KEY,
    single_code,
    '❌ 不合法代碼' AS 問題
FROM SplitValues
WHERE single_code NOT IN ('01','03','04','06','10','11','15','21','38','99')
  AND single_code <> ''
ORDER BY CustPurposeOfAcc;

如果還是出現錯誤，請試下面這個更保守的版本（不用 WITH）：
SELECT 
    b.CustPurposeOfAcc,
    a.NEW_CIF_KEY,
    a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY,
    LTRIM(RTRIM(value)) AS single_code,
    '❌ 不合法代碼' AS 問題
FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP a
JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b 
    ON a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
CROSS APPLY STRING_SPLIT(b.CustPurposeOfAcc, '|') 
WHERE b.CustPurposeOfAcc IS NOT NULL
  AND LTRIM(RTRIM(value)) NOT IN ('01','03','04','06','10','11','15','21','38','99')
  AND LTRIM(RTRIM(value)) <> ''
ORDER BY b.CustPurposeOfAcc;

請直接複製上面第一個修正版執行看看。
